#: ../../source/tutorials/quickstart.rst:82
msgid ""
"The CLI uses pandoc (auto FFI, then CLI) when an FFI writer or ``pandoc`` on "
"``PATH`` is available. Otherwise it keeps the native line parsers (no "
"error). Pass ``--native`` to force today's parsers. Pass ``--use-pandoc`` to "
"require pandoc (error if missing). Editors, wasm, and LSP stay native."
msgstr ""

